Package: spreadpredictor
Title: Neutral-Site College Football Spread Predictor
Version: 0.1.0
Description: A Shiny app and data pipeline that blends four public rating
    systems (SP+, FPI, SRS, Elo) into a spread and win probability for any
    two FBS teams. This file exists so dependencies can be installed with one
    command. The project is an app, not an installable package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    bslib (>= 0.6.0),
    DBI,
    DT,
    ggplot2,
    htmltools,
    jsonlite,
    nnls,
    RSQLite,
    shiny (>= 1.8.0)
Suggests:
    cfbfastR (>= 2.0.0),
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
